Pactrade (PNG) Limited is an establish
FMCG
Distribution Company and Subsidiary of
CJ Patel Group of Companies in Fiji Island
. Pactrade is represented in PNG with its head office in Port Moresby as well as a branch Office in Lae
We are currently seeking applications from suitably qualified individuals to fill the position of
Supply Chain/Procurement Executive
, based in
Port Moresby
. This is a full-time, permanent position.
Key Responsibilities:
Strongly build-up and maintain the company’s supply chain strategy;
Liaising with internal departments to identify procurement needs;
Maintain supply chain inventory and records and provide the reports to the management;
Find cost-effective solutions for supply chain processes; develop and implement best cost accounting practises with proper controls;
Develop and implement safety guidelines in all aspects of the supply chain;
Ensure supply chain processes meet legal requirements and standards;
Job Requirements
Bachelor’s Degree in Supply Chain Management/Diploma in Supply Chain Management or related field;
Proficient in MS Office and computer literacy;
5 to 6 years of experience in oversea purchases, supply chain, logistics and shippment process and procedures.
Strong negotiation and good communication skills in English;
Excellent organizational and project management skills;
Creative problem solving;
A strategic and analytic mind;
Must possess
valid
drivers’ licence;
Minimum of two to three years' experience in FMCG in a similar role; would be an advantage;
Interested applicants please email your CV and cover letter outlining your experience to email address:
[email protected]
